<title>USA: Echelon stake held by group.</title>
<headline>Echelon stake held by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Fir Tree Partners said Thursday it holds 346,192 common shares, or a 5.11 percent stake, in Echelon International Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the shares between March 24 and May 27 at betweeb $18 and $19.13 each.</p>
<p>The group said it holds shares in the St. Petersburg, Fla. company for investment only.</p>
